      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠰᠠᠷᠠᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>serekekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>сэрээх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>SEREGE-</transcript>
      <definition>[= seregyl-, v. caus. of sere-] v. t. To wake (up); to cause to recover one's senses.</definition>
      <page>689</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠥᠷᠯᠦᠭᠡ ᠵᠢᠷᠭᠤᠭᠠᠨ ᠴᠠᠭ ᠎ᠲᠤ ᠨᠠᠮᠠᠶᠢ ᠰᠠᠷᠠᠺᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>ørlyge zirγuγan caγ tu namaji -- I </transcript>
          <definition>Wake me up at six o'clock in the morning</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠡᠳᠺᠢᠯ ᠰᠠᠨᠠᠭ᠎ᠠ ᠎ᠶᠢ ᠰᠠᠷᠠᠺᠠᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>sedkil sanaγ-a ji -- </transcript>
          <definition> To inspire, enthuse; to comfort.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
